/**
 * @defgroup TutrGeo TutrGeo — Tutorial / Test Geometry
 * @ingroup StarVMCGeometry
 * @brief AGML tutorial and shape-catalogue geometry modules (TUTR / ShapGeo)
 *
 * @details
 * TutrGeo is a collection of example and developer-testing AGML geometry
 * modules.  These modules do not describe physical STAR detectors; they are
 * used to demonstrate AGML concepts to new developers and to verify that the
 * geometry framework is functioning correctly.  There is no corresponding
 * Config.xml; the modules are loaded explicitly for testing purposes.
 *
 * Five XML files are provided:
 *
 * - **TutrGeo1** — the minimal AGML module: a 500 cm box mother (TUTR) with
 *   one 10 cm box child (ABOX).  Demonstrates the obligatory `<Module>`,
 *   `<Author>`, `<Created>`, `<Content>`, and `<Volume>` elements.
 *
 * - **TutrGeo2** — extends TutrGeo1 with five additional shape volumes
 *   (ATUB, ATBS, ACON, ACNS) demonstrating tube, tube-segment, cone, and
 *   cone-segment shapes.
 *
 * - **TutrGeo3** — demonstrates structure-driven (parametric) geometry.
 *   A `TUBG` structure with three fill entries defines three concentric tubes
 *   (rmin/rmax: 0/5, 2.5/7.5, 5/10 cm; dz: 10, 10, 15 cm) that are
 *   selected at run time by version number, showing how `<Structure>`,
 *   `<Fill>`, and `<Use select=...>` work together.
 *
 * - **TutrGeo4** — the most complete tutorial module.  Adds PCON (polycone),
 *   PGON (polygon), PARA (parallelepiped, dx=10/dy=8/dz=20 cm with Euler
 *   angles), and ELTU (elliptical tube, p1=10/p2=15/dz=20 cm) to the shapes
 *   demonstrated in TutrGeo2.
 *
 * - **ShapGeo** — a comprehensive catalogue of every AGML-supported TGeo
 *   shape type: BOX, PARA, TRD1, TRD2, TRAP, GTRA, SPHE, TUBE, TUBS, CTUB,
 *   ELTU, HYPE, CONE, CONS, PCON, PGON.  Each shape is placed in a 1000 cm
 *   box mother with representative parameters.  This module serves as a
 *   reference and regression test for the AGML shape-translation layer.
 *   Author: Jason C. Webb (November 2011).
 *
 * @{
 */

/**
 * @file TutrGeo1.xml
 * @brief Minimal AGML tutorial geometry (TutrGeo1 module).
 * TUTR box (500 cm) containing one ABOX child (10 cm).
 * Demonstrates mandatory module elements.
 */

/**
 * @file TutrGeo2.xml
 * @brief Multi-shape AGML tutorial (TutrGeo2 module).
 * Adds ATUB (tube), ATBS (tube segment), ACON (cone), ACNS (cone segment)
 * to the basic box geometry.
 */

/**
 * @file TutrGeo3.xml
 * @brief Parametric geometry tutorial (TutrGeo3 module).
 * Demonstrates Structure/Fill/Use: three ATUB volumes built from TUBG fills
 * with different rmin/rmax/dz values selected by version number.
 */

/**
 * @file TutrGeo4.xml
 * @brief Extended shape tutorial (TutrGeo4 module).
 * All shapes from TutrGeo2 plus APCN (polycone), APGN (polygon),
 * APAR (parallelepiped), and AELT (elliptical tube).
 */

/**
 * @file ShapGeo.xml
 * @brief Exhaustive AGML shape catalogue (ShapGeo module).
 * Demonstrates all supported TGeo shapes: BOX, PARA, TRD1, TRD2, TRAP,
 * GTRA, SPHE, TUBE, TUBS, CTUB, ELTU, HYPE, CONE, CONS, PCON, PGON.
 * Used as a regression test for the AGML-to-TGeo translation layer.
 * Author: Jason C. Webb (November 2011).
 */

/**
 * @}
 */
